QuestGuidance.Register("en",323,{
[10305]="7006AE93\n1\tTalk to Yâshri near Ghâr Mejet\tSeek out Yâshri, located near Ghâr Mejet, and see if you can lend her aid.\n",
[10306]="70035592\n1\tDefeat Writhendowns Bow-masters near Wilsig's memorial\tWrithendowns Bow-masters can be found near Wilsig's memorial. You should defeat the Bow-master riders.\n2\tDefeat Writhendowns Bow-masters near Wilsig's memorial (total: 4)\tWrithendowns Bow-masters can be found near Wilsig's memorial. You should defeat the Bow-master riders.\n3\tCompleted\tWilsig's memorial has been cleansed of the White Hand presence.\n",
[10307]="70071E88\n1\tReach Respected standing with the Kintai of Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n2\tSpeak with Aralath at Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n",
[10308]="7006C956\n1\tReach Respected tier with the Phetêkari\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n2\tVisit Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate to claim your gift\030Visit a Tale-warden's assistant at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n",
[10309]="70071E8D\n1\tReach Respected standing with the Hamât Renewed\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n2\tSpeak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n",
[10310]="70053F1C\n1\tBury the bodies of slain warriors in Arandor (total: 12)\tSlain warriors can be found in Arandor. You should bury the bodies of any slain warriors you come across.\n2\tCompleted\tBuried many slain warriors in Arandor.\n",
[10311]="700265B3\n1\tBurn incense in torches (total: 6)\tBurn incense in the torches on the bridge leading to Tyl Annûn.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will be pleased to hear his ancient kings have been honoured.\n",
[10312]="7006C700\n1\tComplete Instance: Respite in Shonith\tRaphûz and Ashâmi invited you to sit with them to discuss the events of your arrival in Shonith and the future.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou allowed Raphûz and Ashâmi to speak without you at the advice of Lathagwid. You should return to Raphûz at the oasis Shonith to learn how the remainder of the night went.\n",
[10313]="70035595\n1\tDefeat the Writhendowns Captain\tThe White Hand presence is so strong here that it can only be assumed that a captain is nearby. You should defeat the Writhendowns Captain at Cuthard's memorial.\n2\tDefeat the Writhendowns Captain near Cuthard's memorial\tThe White Hand presence is so strong here that it can only be assumed that a captain is nearby. You should defeat the Writhendowns Captain at Cuthard's memorial.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Writhendowns Captain near Cuthard's memorial.\n",
[10314]="70068B64\n1\tSit in the baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward\030Enter the waters of the Baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward\tYosarin asked you to sit in the baths nearby and relax. She does not think you will be able to do it!\n2\tRelax within the baths without leaving\tYosarin challenged you to remain in the baths for two minutes, enjoying the water and not thinking about your daily cares. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Yosarin in the Lower Ward\tYosarin is by the baths in the Lower Ward.\n",
[10315]="7001C495\n1\tDefeat Gostoth\tGostoth may be found in the ruins west of Ost Haer. Narthan asked you to search for the creature Gostoth and destroy it so he can know that his brethren's body is at rest.\n2\tTalk to Narthan at Ost Haer\tNarthan is at Ost Haer. You scoured the ruins west of Ost Haer and discovered the creature Gostoth. You should now return to Narthan and tell him that his brethren is once again at rest.\n",
[10316]="7003574F\n1\tBurn Orc-corpses (total: 8)\tOrc-corpses can be found throughout Grimnesberg. You should burn the Orcs that Cyneberg slaughtered.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have cleaned up Grimnesberg after Cyneberg's heroic efforts to drive out the Orcs.\n",
[10317]="7003045D\n1\tDefeat draugar in Wódscrafen (total: 12)\tDraug can be found in Wódscrafen in the southern Wold, north of Twickenburg. You should defeat many draug in Wódscrafen.\n2\tReturn to the frightened soldier\tThe frightened soldier is outside of Wódscrafen. You should return to the frightened soldier now that you have defeated many of the terrifying draugar in Wódscrafen.\n",
[10318]="7001AF92\n1\tThe Wandering Shade's brother now wanders through the streets of Bree. If the sun is shining, the shade may be summoned by troubling its tomb; at night, search the alleys for the shade. A tomb rests somewhere in Bree, and a shade leaves its confines at night to haunt the streets. The Wandering Shade wishes for you to bring his ring to his brother.\t\n",
[10319]="70022382\n1\tLocate the correct inscription\tThe first cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the north of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\n2\tThe first cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the north of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\t\n3\tLocate the second inscription\tThe second cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\n4\tThe second cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\t\n5\tLocate the last inscription\tThe third cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow further to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\n6\tThe third cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow further to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary. Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.\t\n7\tTalk to Cadelhin at Crug Cadelhin\tCadelhin is at Crug Cadelhin in the Lich Bluffs. Lhudd told you to bring news of Crug Fernvael's location to the shade Cadelhin.\n",
[10320]="700281CE\n1\tExamine cairn-entrances (total: 3)\tThe cairn-entrances lie to the south and west of Bledhun's camp. Bledhun has asked you to examine the entrances of the cairns to see if you can discern what power is behind the raising of the wights.\n2\tTalk to Bledhun at his encampment in the Bonevales\tBledhun awaits your return at his camp to the east and north of the cairn-entrances. You should return to Bledhun and let him know what you found.\n",
[10321]="7005AB0B\n1\tDefeat dwarf-wights in Flogalith (total: 8)\tThe Angmarim have given dwarf-wights to the drakes in Welkin-lofts. You should defeat dwarf-wights in Flogalith.\n2\tTalk to Molkha in the valley\tYou have slain many wights guarding the drake-nest. You should report your success to Molkha. Molkha can be found on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.\n",
[10322]="700032CD\n1\tDefeat bats (total: 8)\tPrisca Underhill is at the entrance of Scary. Prisca Underhill wants you to deal with the bats south of Scary which have become hostile, attacking even during the day.\n2\tTalk to Prisca Underhill\tPrisca Underhill is in Scary, near the entrance to town. Prisca will be pleased to hear that you have done your part to alleviate the threat of the bats outside Scary.\n",
[10323]="7002AEC3\n1\tSperling Took awaits assistance in Bywater. He offers a number of tasks for you to complete. You should help Sperling Took with a restocking task.\t\n",
[10324]="7006AA09\n1\tCollect Ilmabiri crocodile skins (total: 6)\tEshéra has suggested you defeat crocodiles to collect their skins in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tTalk to Eshéra\tYou have collected the skins of defeated crocodiles in the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should bring them to Eshéra at Hêbatokh, her camp in Ilmabiri.\n",
[10325]="7006A9ED\n1\tCollect Ilmabiri bat wings (total: 6)\tEshéra has suggested you defeat bats to collect their wings in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tTalk to Eshéra\tYou have collected the wings of defeated bats in the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should bring them to Eshéra at Hêbatokh, her camp in Ilmabiri.\n",
[10326]="7006C8FE\n1\tCollect time-worn swords (total: 6)\tSigênik has asked you to travel to Shukabad, west of Western Khanâg, and collect time-worn swords there.\n2\tBring the time-worn swords to Sigênik in Western Khanâg\tYou have gone to Shukabad and collected the time-worn swords there. You should bring them to Sigênik in Western Khanâg.\n",
[10327]="70066291\n1\tPlant seeds into empty flower beds (total: 8)\tCellineth has given you a bag of seeds to plant into empty flower beds. You can find these flower beds scattered around Edhellond.\n2\tTalk to Cellineth\tYou have filled every flower bed you could find with seeds. You should return your bag of seeds to Cellineth in Edhellond.\n",
[10328]="7002FEB7\n1\tTalk to Alwyn in the Snowbourn Kitchen\tAlwyn can be found inside the kitchen of Snowbourn. Fastred has praised the mead of Alwyn, a local crofter. He hopes to have mead delivered to his guards stationed at the edges of town in hopes that their spirits will be renewed.\n2\tGather hops from nearby crofts (total: 10)\tHops can be found in the crofts just south of Snowbourn.\n3\tTalk to Alwyn\tAlwyn can be found inside the kitchen of Snowbourn.\n4\tGive the mead to Éosig\030Bring the mead to Éosig at the north gate\030Give the mead to Ithamar\030Bring the mead to Ithamar at the east gate\030Give the mead to Sigbald\030Bring the mead to Sigbald at the east gate\030Give the mead to Ermenrad\030Bring the mead to Ermenrad at the south gate\tYou have been given a powerful mead to bring to the Rohirrim that guard the gates of Snowbourn. Gates can be found at the north, east, and south sides of Snowbourn.\n5\tTalk to Alwyn\tYou have refreshed the soldiers and should now return to the crofter in Snowbourn.\n6\tTalk to Fastred\tFastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. Having delivered the mead to the gate guards of Snowbourn, Fastred will be pleased to know that morale has been restored to his people.\n",
[10329]="7002BFA5\n1\tTalk to Amal\tThe Easterling captain may be found at their camp, east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore. Wynstan asked you to take the Easterling relics you found and treat with the captain of the Easterlings, in hopes of securing a peaceful withdraw.\n2\tBring the relics of the Easterlings to the Easterling captain\tThe Easterling captain may be found at their camp, south of the Woodmen's camp in the Rushgore. Wynstan asked you to take the Easterling relics you found and treat with the captain of the Easterlings, in hopes of securing a peaceful withdraw.\n3\tTalk to Wynstan at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore\tWynstan is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, west of the Easterling camp. You should return to Wynstan with Rozi's pledge and warning.\n",
[10330]="70002EEE\n1\tCollect lynx-pelts (total: 6)\tLynx can be found in the wooded areas north or east of Frerin's Court and to the north of the Elf-camp. [see journal] asked you to defeat the Lynx found throughout Thorin's Gate and bring back their pelts.\n2\tTalk to Laergil\030Collect Lynx-pelt (total: 6)\tBring the lynx-pelts you gathered back to [see journal].\n",
[10331]="70018EC9\n1\tCollect lynx-pelts (total: 4)\tHighland cubs and highland prowlers can be found in the wooded areas north or east of Frerin's Court. Nos Grimsong asked you to defeat the lynx found throughout Thorin's Gate and bring back their pelts.\n2\tBring the lynx-pelts to Nos Grimsong in Frerin's Court\tNos Grimsong is in the north-west corner of Frerin's Court. Bring the lynx-pelts you gathered back to Nos Grimsong.\n",
[10332]="7005A99E\n1\tFill up the water jug\030Plant seeds in the first planter (quantity: see journal)\030Plant seeds in the second planter (quantity: see journal)\030Plant seeds in the third planter (quantity: see journal)\030Plant seeds in the fourth planter (quantity: see journal)\030Plant seeds in the fifth planter (quantity: see journal)\tA good place to fill up the empty water jug and the planters can be found in south-west Máttugard. You should fill up the empty water jug and plant seeds in the planters.\n2\tPlanters can be found in south-west Máttugard. You should water the planters that you have seeded.\t\n3\tCompleted\tSeeded and watered the planters.\n",
[10333]="7003783A\n1\tTalk to Téothic\tTéothic is at the training hall of Aldburg in the eastern part of the town. Arcil asked you to aid the people of Aldburg as they try to bring back the glory of the old capital, starting with Téothic.\n2\tBuild a barricade in front of the Aldburg training hall\tTéothic has asked you to build a barricade to help with the defence of the training hall.\n3\tTalk to Téothic\tTéothic is at the training hall of Aldburg in the eastern part of the city. You should speak with Téothic and let him know your work is finished.\n4\tTalk to Wilflad\tWilflad is at the stable of Aldburg. Téothic suggested that Wilflad might need help at the stable.\n5\tRepair the fallen beams on the stable\tWilflad asked for the beams of the stable to be repaired in order to bring more stalls into use.\n6\tTalk to Wilflad\tWilflad is at the stable of Aldburg. The beams have been repaired, and now more horses will be able to be housed in the stable. You should speak with Wilflad to let her know of your progress.\n7\tTalk to Bertred\tBertred, Quartermaster of Aldburg, is at his house in the western part of the city. Wilflad believes that the Quartermaster might also be able to use some assistance, though she is not sure what his needs are.\n8\tMend Bertred's fence\tBertred has asked for assistance mending his fence.\n9\tTalk to Bertred\tBertred is at his house in the western part of Aldburg. You should let Bertred know that you have mended his fence.\n10\tTalk to Arcil\tThane Arcil is at the Mead Hall of Aldburg. You should return to Thane Arcil and inform him that you have aided the people of Aldburg.\n",
[10334]="7006656B\n1\tTalk to Erchar at Dol Brannor\tLainil wants you to speak to Erchar at Dol Brannor for more information on the restoration of Barad Rill. Dol Brannor is west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.\n",
[10335]="70002D05\n1\tCollect pea-plants (total: 10)\tPea-plants can be found in the farmland outside the city of Donnvail, north-east of Fail-á-Khro. Cána has tasked you with recovering the pea-plants from the farms outside Donnvail.\n2\tBring pea-plants to Cána\tCána is at Fail-á-Khro, on the road north of Aughaire. You have harvested pea-plants from the farms near Donnvail to keep them from the enemies of the Trév Gállorg.\n",
[10336]="7004DA3D\n1\tComplete quests to aid Dale, Erebor, or Eryn Lasgalen (total: 8)\tQuests to aid the Strongholds of the North can be found in Dale, Erebor, Felegoth, Lake-town, Loeglond, and Ravenhill. Dale, Erebor, and Eryn Lasgalen are in need of aid to restore their Kingdoms to their former splendour. You should aid them.\n",
})
